	(text "Copied from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheet 23.\nU (RK860-2) big core 0 and U (RK860-3) big core 1 share I2C0; the NPU regulator (RK860-2) is on I2C1.\nEach VOUT pin is the remote sense input: it goes to <rail>_FB, tied to the rail at the processor.\nVCC_3V3_S0 switch: SY6280AAC in place of the reference's SGM2576/TT9107 (same pinout and current-limit\nformula, 6800 / R in amps; 4.7K gives 1.45 A). The reference's LCD supply is not needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
